    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. so if the flute has all those integer multiples, does that mean the sound can sometimes feel a bit \"unpredictable\" or \"erratic\" depending on how the air hits the embouchure? like, are there ever these shadowy, unintended frequencies that pop up in the background of a note that aren't part of the main melody?",
