      "role": "user",
      "content": "right, sidebands and inharmonic partials. it's interesting how they aren't \"correct\" notes, just these little mischievous little bursts of sound that seem to hide in the noise. do musicians ever talk about these unwanted frequencies as if they have their own little personality, or are they just treated as technical flaws to be managed?",
